fastcompress contains code that follows the zstd library and is altered:

  zstd/zstd_enc_entropy.go  normalizeCounts, normalizeM2, writeNCount,
                            optimalTableLog, fseEnc and fseWeights, from
                            FSE_normalizeCount, FSE_normalizeM2,
                            FSE_writeNCount, FSE_optimalTableLog,
                            FSE_buildCTable, FSE_initCState2, FSE_encodeSymbol
                            and FSE_compress_usingCTable
  zstd/zstd_enc.go          the order of encodeSeqBits, from
                            ZSTD_encodeSequences

